    "Define an explicit compatibility and sync protocol between the mother framework and the CangHUI Harmony adapter.",
    "Prove a platform adapter consuming the CangHui mother contracts without source duplication.",
    "Add lifecycle, IME, accessibility and native-surface service interfaces before claiming a complete platform host abstraction.",
    "Implement and independently verify an external SoonLink Channel v1 KModeChannelModule before claiming relay-backed operation.",
    "Do not expose kMode as production remote administration without authentication, authorization, audit and deployment gates.",
    "Do not claim Android or iOS runtime support from desktop layout previews.",
    "Implement the UIKit CAMetalLayer/MTKView surface proxy after the static-package bootstrap protocol is available.",
    "Bind SDL_EnterAppMainCallbacks for OwnedWindow mode only after Cangjie static-package initialization is established.",
    "Keep product models, relay endpoints, credentials and file-manager screens in consumer applications; use them as acceptance consumers rather than framework source.",
    "Keep ArkUI Search, Counter, indeterminate LoadingProgress, Refresh, Swiper and navigation-stack semantics open until dedicated common controls and interaction tests land.",
    "Treat Material, Ant Design and Arco provider catalogs as the currently audited subsets; expand each inventory only with frozen upstream source and renderer proof.",
    "Add a separate reduced-motion/accessibility policy before claiming accessibility-complete motion behavior.",
    "Keep Web, Video, Map and XComponent-class host rendering platform-bound; desktop common-layout previews do not prove those adapters.",
    "Keep runtime application-global persistence separate from cuic project script discovery; State, rememberState, StateStore and HostApplicationStorage do not currently constitute AppStorage.init()."
